WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
The suited fighter looks at his watch through dark glasses.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.400
He loosens his spotted tie beside the office time clock.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.700
The clock hits eighteen hundred. He draws his wrapped blade and makes one clean rush.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.500
A single bright strike scatters a stack of overdue paperwork.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.200
He calmly presents his timecard and picks up his briefcase.

6
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.400
The fighter walks away. The time clock is left to finish the battle.
